# Static IP -> device-name map for numa-metrics enrichment.
# Lets the agent attach device names when it runs on the laptop pointing at a
# remote numa (avahi can't see the Pi's LAN). Copy to devices.txt and edit.
# Format: <IP> <name>   ('#' comments allowed; extra fields ignored)
192.168.1.1   router
192.168.1.13  desktop
192.168.1.21  kids-pc
192.168.1.50  pi-dns
